# the Roland-style kits in DUSTKIT: pick the engine (HOME + PRESET), a block (HOME + FX), a kit preset (HOME + white key)
wait 300
press HOME
tapkey b4
release HOME
wait 2500
press HOME
tap FX
release HOME
press HOME
tap FX
release HOME
wait 50
expect blk 2
press HOME
tapkey w8
release HOME
wait 500
expect eng 5
expect blk 2
shot kit_808.png
press HOME
tapkey w10
release HOME
wait 500
shot kit_909.png
press HOME
tap SEL
release HOME
press HOME
tapkey w8
release HOME
wait 500
expect blk 1
shot kit_606.png
